{"timestamp": 1786803956.0768743, "session_id": "CS-1786803016479", "action_type": "git_commit", "detail": "feat(dreamos): P1接线完成 PROP-20260815 — E层认知反馈闭环补全\n\nP1-1 E→B认知注入: run_cycle读取get_cognitive_context(), confidence_adjustment\n  注入B层信号置信度(保留confidence_raw/cognitive_adjustment审计字段)\nP1-2 lessons持久化: CognitiveReviewer.load_lessons()启动加载 + persist自动建目录,\n  OrchestratorV2初始化即加载,认知记忆重启不再失忆\nP1-3 真实盈亏反馈: 移除run_cycle伪造pnl=0审查(改为awaiting_real_feedback快照),\n  新增record_real_exit()回填入口; auto_trader.run_exit_check_all()平仓后\n  → _feed_cognitive_loop() → 真实审查+lessons落盘+W/L/累计PnL/连败计数更新\n  (try/except降级,认知回填失败不影响持仓管家主流程)\n\nBug修复: 测试与生产共用STATE_FILE导致污染(测试写入-145USDT假亏损/假贝叶斯触发)\n  → tests/conftest.py autouse隔离(STATE_FILE/LESSONS_FILE/POSITIONS_FILE→tmp)\n  → 生产状态已恢复(cycles=114保留,W/L/PnL/贝叶斯计数归零)\n测试契约更新: phase7审查断言改为awaiting_real_feedback新契约;\n  cognitive_injection重写为真实P1-1闭环验证; coin_selector source断言\n  接受persisted:hermes-weekly(a277445优先级变更)\n\n验证: 52/52测试全绿; 端到端冒烟通过(亏损单→3条教训→落盘→跨实例加载→注入生效)\n红线: V9参数未动/14-V15未动/A系列cron未动/零真单(仅影子模式)", "commit_hash": "26a9e4f", "files": ["1-ARCHITECTURE/dreamos/capabilities/trading/cognitive_reviewer.py", "1-ARCHITECTURE/dreamos/capabilities/trading/orchestrator_v2.py", "1-ARCHITECTURE/dreamos/cli/auto_trader.py", "1-ARCHITECTURE/dreamos/tests/conftest.py", "1-ARCHITECTURE/dreamos/tests/test_coin_selector.py", "1-ARCHITECTURE/dreamos/tests/test_phase7_closed_loop.py"]}
